SKZ9Z9XA9qFPwQqOzNTfbOqmHdCbrbJg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTaS1X2qcs5TlgcpUfpL1_AyS0Lg8vP5_-aQ6YnDZMO7Q&oe=6B0B3133"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "IBMS SpaceLab", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Set inside a futuristic SpaceLab, users are guided through interactive journeys, taking control of either a simulated urine or blood sample and following it through each stage of testing. From sample collection to result analysis, participants get a close-up look at the complex processes behind diagnosing illness.\n\nThis isn\u2019t just a virtual experience, it\u2019s an invitation to explore what biomedical scientists do and why their work matters. It offers young people the chance to see if a career in biomedical science might be right for them.\n\nAt the end of the journey, participants are asked: \u201cDo you have what it takes to become a biomedical scientist?\u201d\n\nThe IBMS Accredited SpaceLab is designed to spark curiosity, break down barriers, and inspire the next generation of healthcare professionals.", "short_description": "Step into the IBMS Space Lab: a VR journey into biomedical science.\nOur fully immersive VR experience brings biomedical science to life, showcasing the vital role biomedical scientists play in modern healthcare.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liquona.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Liquona", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://liquona.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recomme